oarding pass invites. I have made my own logo and want to incorporate it. I am looking for a blank template for the boarding pass that only has the shape\/outline or someone who knows how to make it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878655,"PostDate":1416338530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm planning on making my own boarding pass invites. I have made my own logo and want to incorporate it. I am looking for a blank template for the boarding pass that only has the shape\/outline or someone who knows how to make it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pounce007@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.55.68.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412270411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280230.jpg?_r=1416338721","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PenneyGiles","Id":280230,"Name":"PenneyGiles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.37.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78397,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by kmk2016, 18 November 2014 - 11:38 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1416339486,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e9b9df03f415918aac62ee644eca29c","RawContent":"There are tons on these boards.... Yo