" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":390,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56bcac8d6023a4380bdf30b110397f1c","RawContent":"&lt;strong&gt;Quote&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;font size=\"1\"&gt;Make it a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/sandiego.nyctourist.com\/sandiego-weddings.php\"&gt;Wedding Vegas&lt;\/a&gt; or &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/lasvegas.nyctourist.com\/las-vegas-weddings.php\"&gt;Wedding San Diego&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n Every bride wants her wedding to be unique and her wedding invitation is no different. Finding the perfect beach wedding invitation wording is as important as finding the perfect beach wedding invitation itself...\n \n \n \n This is so very true! I do believe that the wording is just as important as the actual invitation. It is a package deal... \n I have always wanted a &amp;quot;destination wedding&amp;quot; and hope that one day, my dream will come true. I am 24 and feel that time is ticking and I don&#039;t have any solid commitment from my boyfriend of 2 years. My family tells me to be patient but I am having a really hard time with it. All of my close friends are or already have planned their weddings. I want my turn!!!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":832604,"PostDate":1252353250,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <strong>Quote<\/strong>:<font size=\"1\">Make it a <a href='http:\/\/sandiego.nyctourist.com\/sandiego-weddings.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Vegas<\/a> or <a href='http:\/\/lasvegas.nyctourist.com\/las-vegas-weddings.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding San Diego<\/a><\/font><br \/> Every bride wants her wedding to be unique and her wedding invitation is no different. Finding the perfect beach wedding invitation wording is as important as finding the perfect beach wedding invitation itself...<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> This is so very true! I do believe that the wording is just as important as the actual invitation. It is a package deal... <br \/> I have always wanted a \"destination wedding\" and hope that one day, my dream will come true. I am 24 and feel that time is ticking and I don't have any solid commitment from my boyfriend of 2 years. My family tells me to be patient but I am having a really hard time with it. All of my close friends are or already have planned their weddings. I want my turn!!!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marejada@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1244492554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218233.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jadamar","Id":218233,"Name":"jadamar","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":390,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"685da1b12bc14566400eda4d118c3da9","RawContent":"This is wonderful, thank you for sharing. Definitely good advise.\n \n Dea","Attachments":[],"Id":832608,"PostDate":1252353649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is wonderful, thank you for sharing. Definitely good advise.<br \/> <br \/> Dea\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"d.ronnie@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250903645,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl"