==============================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893305\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429160237,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80542,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  when my dad passed away, my mom was left to take care of an 8 year old, 6 year old and 3 year old. His last year was spent in the hospital since he was having treatment for intestinal cancer. I do get sad at times not knowing if the memories I have of him are real or if they're made from stori...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893303\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429160206,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80540,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429160144,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80534,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by vancouverpetunia.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893297\n\nThe post that vancouverpetunia submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893306\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you lol\n\nYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!\n-----------------------------\n\n \nHaha! Maybe I should have said sorry?  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429134380,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80529,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  when my dad passed away, my mom was left to take care of an 8 year old, 6 year old and 3 year old. His last year was spent in the hospital since he was having treatment for intestinal cancer. I do get sad at times not knowing if the memories I have of him are real or if they're made from stori...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893303\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429132263,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80526,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you  lolYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893297\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429131326,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80523,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that acw271011 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893298\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" You gave me goosebumps. My dad was left with 3 kids to raise too after my mom passed away. My sister and I were older but my brother was only 6. He had a bit of a crisis when he was about 20 years old because he couldn't remember what she looked like anymore. My sister and I copied pictures that we had and made an album for him to keep. My dad never remarried either.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429130429,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80521,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429130311,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80520,"Title":"liked a post you made in Chair In Memory Of Mother","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sorry to hear about your mom. My dad passed away when I was only 6 years old but still miss him dearly. I get sad at the thought of not having a father\/daughter dance but I know he'll be there in spirit. My mom raised three kids on her own and I admire her for her strength. So it was a no...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79067-chair-in-memory-of-mother\/?view=findpost&p=1893296\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429130259,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80293,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWoohoo, congrats on all the good news @ ! I'm so happy to hear about the weight loss and especially the inch loss. That's so exciting. Good for you for being so disciplined!And I'm so happy to hear about $200 off. That's such a great price!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1893189\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429081445,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80204,"Title":"sent you a friend request","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nvancouverpetunia wants to be your friend!\n\nThis message has been sent because vancouverpetunia has added you to their friends\nlist. As you've chosen to approve all friend requests, you will need to visit your\nfriends list and approve them.\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&section=friends&module=profile&do=list&tab=pending\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429048454,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":281283},{"Id":80057,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nAbsolutely!  Let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  no one else has expressed interest yet, but if they do, i'll check back with you first!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9375&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429009321,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9375},{"Id":80047,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nHi Wafflesmom!\n \nIt's quoting me $38.65 - not sure if it'd be worth it for you to order it new then?  Not sure how much it is off of Amazon to Canada :S\n \nIf you want it, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  \n \nThanks!\nMarina\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9375&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008810,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9375},{"Id":80043,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893090\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" I bought both at the same time and used both coupons. It depends on how nice the person is at checkout lol, but usually I have Chester with me when we goto Walmart.. so worst case I would've just given him one to buy. They can't deny the person with you.\n \nYes! go with the Pepto.. they are actually perfect. They come in a box and they have 48 per box. It's not the small box that the pills\/capsules are in - it's a bigger box & they are the full sized chewables\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008481,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80039,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks @ ! So the coupon works on top of the sale price? Were you able to use two coupons two but two boxes at the same time? Or did you have to pay for each separately?And thank you guys for the pepto tip! I was going to buy rolls of tums but it's not the sameI agree @ , this forum is awesom...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893088\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008372,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80028,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that veryvalentine mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893086\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" @\"perianjay\"\n \nThanks sooo much for sharing this!  How amazing is this forum?  I can't even imagine planning this wedding without this forum.  I would be left with no friends if I only had them to go back and forth with these things.  lol  Nobody really cares as much as we do!!  I'm so excited to use my coupon!  Thank you ladies! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429007732,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80022,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893084\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" @snswedding2015 @\"veryvalentine\"\n \nI bought Emergen-C from Walmart and used my coupon. I believe Emergen-C was only $10 at Walmart when I bought it - I used the $5 coupon and I bought two boxes. I also purchased my Pepto from there as well.. They came in plastic individual wrap (48 pack). I just had to cut them into twos.\nI paid $20 for a total of 96 chewables and I plan to give two per person or four per couple.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429007532,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80015,"Title":"liked a post you made in Sparklers! (Reception,...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I've been wanting to do this as well but not sure how feasible it is to get sparklers so thanks for starting the thread!@  thanks for the tip on asking your photographer, I'll see if he can get some for me.Do you guys think you can light them by having lit candles (bigger ones) say maybe a...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79058-sparklers-reception-first-dance\/?view=findpost&p=1893071\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429007060,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80014,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by marinah84.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79062-wallybags-66-inch-tri-fold-destination-bag-90\/?view=findpost&p=1893081\n\nThe post that marinah84 submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79062-wallybags-66-inch-tri-fold-destination-bag-90\/?view=findpost&p=1893082\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"marinah84\" I'd be interested but not sure how much shipping would be to Canada\n-----------------------------\n\n \n \nMessage me your zip code\/postal code, and I'll look it up!  It weighs about 4.5lbs shipped, though the box is a little awkward.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429006849,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"337","TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":330},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
