> User Wafflesmom (279721)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df5a4be1ff6e8ef80eebf6ddc2c2171a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsSam\" post=\"1891554\" timestamp=\"1427904233\"]\nNice!! I&#039;m not a huge fan of AC, I much prefer Westjet but if AC has better rates then I&#039;ll for sure use them.. I especially like the upgrade to the bride and groom!! I&#039;d love to fly first class :P[\/quote]\nThey aren&#039;t my first choice either, I actually would prefer Sunwing or West Jet but they were the cheapest price with the best bonus!  So that was ok for me. We had no problems with them. Everything was on time and all the baggage made it, etc.  First class was a dream, will be hard to go back to economy in August when we go to Vegas!","Attachments":[],"Id":1891673,"PostDate":1427956222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsSam, on 01 April 2015 - 09:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Nice!! I'm not a huge fan of AC, I much prefer Westjet but if AC has better rates then I'll for sure use them.. I especially like the upgrade to the bride and groom!! I'd love to fly first class <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They aren't my first choice either, I actually would prefer Sunwing or West Jet but they were the cheapest price with the best bonus! \u00a0So that was ok for me. We had no problems with them. Everything was on time and all the baggage made it, etc. \u00a0First class was a dream, will be hard to go back to economy in August when we go to Vegas!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428012051,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"605460aee0bf31f6bf5f4a95fd34fb28","RawContent":"@[member=\"misbosox\"] thanks for the update! I still don&#039;t understand how they&#039;re going to define what a \"professional\" camera will look like. My brother in law has a digital SLR camera and I know he&#039;ll take photos but he&#039;s not our photographer. We&#039;ve hired a professional and paying the external vendor fee, are they now going to charge us twice if he takes pictures? \n\n\n@[member=\"FutureMrsSam\"] I missed the second part of your question. We chose to use the complimentary package as I wanted to customize and personalize the look of both our ceremony and reception. With the complimentary, you get a restaurant reservation. If a private event, it comes with standard table, white tablecloth and standard chairs. No centerpieces or decor.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891754,"PostDate":1428011972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a> thanks for the update! I still don't understand how they're going to define what a \"professional\" camera will look like. My brother in law has a digital SLR camera and I know he'll take photos but he's not our photographer. We've hired a professional and paying the external vendor fee, are they now going to charge us twice if he takes pictures? <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276191\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276191-futuremrssam\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsSam<\/span><\/a> I missed the second part of your question. We chose to use the complimentary package as I wanted to customize and personalize the look of both our ceremony and reception. With the complimentary, you get a restaurant reservation. If a private event, it comes with standard table, white tablecloth and standard chairs. No centerpieces or decor.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410073385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.201.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1675f22e2c210f1891e024a257fa3756","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1891754\" timestamp=\"1428037172\"]\n@[member=\"misbosox\"] thanks for the update! I still don&#039;t understand how they&#039;re going to define what a \"professional\" camera will look like. My brother in law has a digital SLR camera and I know he&#039;ll take photos but he&#039;s not our photographer. We&#039;ve hired a professional and paying the external vendor fee, are they now going to charge us twice if he takes pictures?\n\n@[member=\"FutureMrsSam\"] I missed the second part of your question. We chose to use the complimentary package as I wanted to customize and personalize the look of both our ceremony and reception. With the complimentary, you get a restaurant reservation. If a private event, it comes with standard table, white tablecloth and standard chairs. No centerpieces or decor.[\/quote]\nThanks @[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] :) I appreciate your input on this :) I&#039;m still torn about what to do but I guess I have time to make a final decision","Attachments":[],"Id":1892282,"PostDate":1428474877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 02 April 2015 - 09:59 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a> thanks for the update! I still don't understand how they're going to define what a \"professional\" camera will look like. My brother in law has a digital SLR camera and I know he'll take photos but he's not our photographer. We've hired a professional and paying the external vendor fee, are they now going to charge us twice if he takes pictures?<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276191\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276191-futuremrssam\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsSam<\/span><\/a> I missed the second part of your question. We chose to use the complimentary package as I wanted to customize and personalize the look of both our ceremony and reception. With the complimentary, you get a restaurant reservation. If a private event, it comes with standard table, white tablecloth and standard chairs. No centerpieces or decor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I appreciate your input on this <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm still torn about what to do but I guess I have time to make a final decision<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dnyomba@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.66.184","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390090658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsSam","Id":276191,"Name":"FutureMrsSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.115.218.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76fa70e50bc88dbf1d9467536dfb679b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Quick question: Has anyone had their wedding coordinator stop working at the MP? I tried to contact my coordinator through email the other day, and I got a response email saying it was un-deliverable. And its the same email address i&#039;ve always used to contact her. I tried to email the coordinator who i was initially in contact with, but no luck so far.....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892516,"PostDate":1428585751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Quick question: Has anyone had their wedding coordinator stop working at the MP? I tried to contact my coordinator through email the other day, and I got a response email saying it was un-deliverable. And its the same email address i've always used to contact her. I tried to email the coordinator who i was initially in contact with, but no luck so far.....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"socergurl12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.199.144","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399392582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277869.jpg?_r=1403305138","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tbone12","Id":277869,"Name":"tbone12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f975118ee3044bf8ff70306dac2b810","RawContent":"@[member=\"tbone12\"] I don&#039;t think I&#039;ve heard of this happening at Moon Palace. My wedding coordinator is being moved to another Palace so I&#039;m being assigned a new one, but she emailed me to let me know and we&#039;re doing an official hand over this week. Who is\/was your coordinator?","Attachments":[],"Id":1892537,"PostDate":1428595038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277869\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277869-tbone12\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tbone12<\/span><\/a> I don't think I've heard of this happening at Moon Palace. My wedding coordinator is being moved to another Palace so I'm being assigned a new one, but she emailed me to let me know and we're doing an official hand over this week. Who is\/was your coordinator?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410073385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.115.218.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"212e85c873289ceb048195b4b66642eb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1892537\" timestamp=\"1428620238\"]\n@[member=\"tbone12\"] I don&#039;t think I&#039;ve heard of this happening at Moon Palace. My wedding coordinator is being moved to another Palace so I&#039;m being assigned a new one, but she emailed me to let me know and we&#039;re doing an official hand over this week. Who is\/was your coordinator?[\/quote]\nMy coordinator is\/was Alejandra Arias. Whenever I contacted her before, she was pretty good about getting back to me fairly quickly. No one informed me that anyone was leaving..","Attachments":[],"Id":1892540,"PostDate":1428600219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 09 April 2015 - 03:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277869\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277869-tbone12\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tbone12<\/span><\/a> I don't think I've heard of this happening at Moon Palace. My wedding coordinator is being moved to another Palace so I'm being assigned a new one, but she emailed me to let me know and we're doing an official hand over this week. Who is\/was your coordinator?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My coordinator is\/was Alejandra Arias. Whenever I contacted her before, she was pretty good about getting back to me fairly quickly. No one informed me that anyone was leaving..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"socergurl12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.199.144","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399392582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277869.jpg?_r=1403305138","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tbone12","Id":277869,"Name":"tbone12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1d5532ebbe2a9d7f3ff0a6d89639bf9","RawContent":"@[member=\"tbone12\"] that&#039;s really strange. Did you go through a travel agent to book your wedding with Moon Palace? If so, he or she can always contact them for you to see what&#039;s happened. Or try to reply to a previous email she sent to ensure the email address is correct.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892543,"PostDate":1428604122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277869\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277869-tbone12\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tbone12<\/span><\/a> that's really strange. Did you go through a travel agent to book your wedding with Moon Palace? If so, he or she can always contact them for you to see what's happened. Or try to reply to a previous email she sent to ensure the email address is correct. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410073385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.126.157.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcd51ef57a099d0aa57d5261e272618c","RawContent":"Hello, it&#039;s great to see how everyone&#039;s plans are coming together. My date is 26th April 2016 at the Catholic Chapel and booked the Immaculate Conception Package in order to get the chapel as we are not actually having a Catholic ceremony, it will be a civil\/Christian ceremony. That&#039;s the only thing we have confirmed so far. \n\n\nCurrently looking into photographers. Absolutely love Del Sol but they are outside of the budget we&#039;d like to spend when you add the vendor fee. \n\n\nOur colours are blush and either gold or grey. Haven&#039;t decided yet but I think I&#039;m leaning more towards blush and gold with a burst of coral in the flowers to add some dimension. \n\n\nOur STD&#039;s were sent to the printers this week so we should have them next week!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892593,"PostDate":1428622110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, it's great to see how everyone's plans are coming together. My date is 26th April 2016 at the Catholic Chapel and booked the Immaculate Conception Package in order to get the chapel as we are not actually having a Catholic ceremony, it will be a civil\/Christian ceremony. That's the only thing we have confirmed so far. <br><br>\nCurrently looking into photographers. Absolutely love Del Sol but they are outside of the budget we'd like to spend when you add the vendor fee. <br><br>\nOur colours are blush and either gold or grey. Haven't decided yet but I think I'm leaning more towards blush and gold with a burst of coral in the flowers to add some dimension. <br><br>\nOur STD's were sent to the printers this week so we should have them next week! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420489204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.223.18.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428652898,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53b469b48cc3c433e269b3cf5f125aa3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"] congratulations!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892650,"PostDate":1428652879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a> congratulations!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362572829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.205.216.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"7eb3ecb982d9c49eb573ced2f5431806","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1892543\" timestamp=\"1428629322\"]\n@[member=\"tbone12\"] that&#039;s really strange. Did you go through a travel agent to book your wedding with Moon Palace? If so, he or she can always contact them for you to see what&#039;s happened. Or try to reply to a previous email she sent to ensure the email address is correct.[\/quote]\nYes, we did go through a travel agent. I just sent her an email to see if she can help me out. Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892659,"PostDate":1428657159,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 09 April 2015 - 06:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277869\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277869-tbone12\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tbone12<\/span><\/a> that's really strange. Did you go through a travel agent to book your wedding with Moon Palace? If so, he or she can always contact them for you to see what's happened. Or try to reply to a previous email she sent to ensure the email address is correct.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, we did go through a travel agent. I just sent her an email to see if she can help me out. Thanks so much!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"socergurl12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.199.144","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399392582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277869.jpg?_r=1403305138","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tbone12","Id":277869,"Name":"tbone12","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":87,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
