{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.126.157.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1a3f13b539aeb45a6894dbc2dfe4fb9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DianaSRZ\" post=\"1892650\" timestamp=\"1428678079\"]\n@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"] congratulations!!!!\n\nOur date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses![\/quote]Thank you! Congratulations to you too! \n\nLuckie is on my list of photographers to contact so great to hear his responses are fast. :)\n\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892694,"PostDate":1428674269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DianaSRZ, on 10 April 2015 - 08:01 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a> congratulations!!!!<br><br>\nOur date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you! Congratulations to you too! <br><br>\nLuckie is on my list of photographers to contact so great to hear his responses are fast. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420489204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.173.146.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"be20311ae956708845ebd2a4c2635658","RawContent":"Did anyone do the preview promotion at moon palace, or any other palace resort? We&#039;re going down in May to check out the resort and I&#039;m so excited! We already have the wedding booked for October but I can&#039;t wait to see where it will actually be happening! Our coordinator is supposed to be setting up meetings with the different vendors we can use and a food tasting. I was wondering if anyone else did this and how much you were actual able to plan while you were there? I&#039;m hoping to get a lot of details figured out while we&#039;re visiting, it seems like it should be easier than the back and forth emails with the coordinator [emoji53]. Anyway, I was just looking for any advice of things to check out\/plan while we&#039;re down there!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892873,"PostDate":1428868508,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Did anyone do the preview promotion at moon palace, or any other palace resort? We're going down in May to check out the resort and I'm so excited! We already have the wedding booked for October but I can't wait to see where it will actually be happening! Our coordinator is supposed to be setting up meetings with the different vendors we can use and a food tasting. I was wondering if anyone else did this and how much you were actual able to plan while you were there? I'm hoping to get a lot of details figured out while we're visiting, it seems like it should be easier than the back and forth emails with the coordinator [emoji53]. Anyway, I was just looking for any advice of things to check out\/plan while we're down there! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleentf09@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.48.23.35","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1414401114,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colleentf09","Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"991eac84300542bf455b4539295b6b95","RawContent":"@[member=\"colleentf09\"] I&#039;m so jealous! We aren&#039;t able to take advantage of the promotion but agree that it would make wedding planning to see everything first hand. Please post tons of pics and include a detailed review, especially of the food choices","Attachments":[],"Id":1892875,"PostDate":1428869380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280885\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280885-colleentf09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">colleentf09<\/span><\/a> I'm so jealous! We aren't able to take advantage of the promotion but agree that it would make wedding planning to see everything first hand. Please post tons of pics and include a detailed review, especially of the food choices \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410073385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.74.56.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428990884,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07fba0f2fb6c926febcd7cb3e810ff16","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DianaSRZ\" post=\"1892650\" timestamp=\"1428678079\"]\n@[member=\"SunshineDreamKay\"] congratulations!!!!\n\nOur date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses![\/quote]congratulations @[member=\"DianaSRZ\"]! \n\nWe&#039;re getting married on the same day! Where are your locations?","Attachments":[],"Id":1893003,"PostDate":1428990755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DianaSRZ, on 10 April 2015 - 08:01 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281615\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281615-sunshinedreamkay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SunshineDreamKay<\/span><\/a> congratulations!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our date is Nov 27, 2015 and he hired Luckie Photography! Great price, lovely pictures and super fast responses!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>congratulations @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"266979\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/266979-dianasrz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DianaSRZ<\/span><\/a>!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're getting married on the same day! Where are your locations?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.craig.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.184.35.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425924701,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RJE","Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.207.185.200","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00abe89b6bb8c059771d6f23987cbaf1","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"RJE\"]!\n\n\nHow exciting!!! Same day!\n\n\nWe&#039;re having a beach ceremony and cocktail hour and reception at Tucan Garden and Terrace!\n\n\nYou?","Attachments":[],"Id":1893122,"PostDate":1429020201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282373\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282373-rje\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RJE<\/span><\/a>!<br><br>\nHow exciting!!! Same day!<br><br>\nWe're having a beach ceremony and cocktail hour and reception at Tucan Garden and Terrace!<br><br>\nYou?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"calipso78@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.223.28.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362572829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DianaSRZ","Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.228.102.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e97a9f29157c20fdefa5abc889ad783","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All, thank you for creating this Forum! So helpful! &amp;amp; congrats to everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re set for &lt;strong&gt;July 3, 2016&lt;\/strong&gt; symbolic ceremony at Moon Palace. Seems far away but lots to do! Right now, we&#039;re trying to get a list of the approved vendors, but it&#039;s like pulling teeth... We received the dropbox link, but it only includes: Audiovisual-JSAV*, Decoration-GAMA, Optional Flowers-Palace Resorts, Fireworks-Promedsa, Live Entertainment-Tempo Consulting, Hair &amp;amp; Makeup-MVP, Precios, Styling Trio, Photographer-DreamArt, Photobooth-La Cabina.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve seen others have gone with vendors that are not on this list, but may also be approved? Can anyone reply with a list of anyone else who is approved\/who we are missing? &lt;em&gt;*Seems like DiscoMovil may be worth the fee! Is PSAV approved?&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, has there been any resolution to the $400 family-member photographer charge? We have multiple people who will have SLR cameras and multiple cousins who actually are photographers... how do they distinguish between \"professional photographer\" and family member who is also a photographer?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893259,"PostDate":1429109591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All, thank you for creating this Forum! So helpful! & congrats to everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're set for <strong>July 3, 2016<\/strong> symbolic ceremony at Moon Palace. Seems far away but lots to do! Right now, we're trying to get a list of the approved vendors, but it's like pulling teeth... We received the dropbox link, but it only includes: Audiovisual-JSAV*, Decoration-GAMA, Optional Flowers-Palace Resorts, Fireworks-Promedsa, Live Entertainment-Tempo Consulting, Hair & Makeup-MVP, Precios, Styling Trio, Photographer-DreamArt, Photobooth-La Cabina.\u00a0 I've seen others have gone with vendors that are not on this list, but may also be approved? Can anyone reply with a list of anyone else who is approved\/who we are missing? <em>*Seems like DiscoMovil may be worth the fee! Is PSAV approved?<\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, has there been any resolution to the $400 family-member photographer charge? We have multiple people who will have SLR cameras and multiple cousins who actually are photographers... how do they distinguish between \"professional photographer\" and family member who is also a photographer?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nelsonmorss@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.228.102.66","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426001442,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282385.jpg?_r=1426290839","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":262,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nelmo","Id":282385,"Name":"nelmo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80a2a232d90ef54a02f2b1602d3f8442","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"nelmo\"], congrats on securing your date and venue!!! Have you been appointed your offsite coordinator?\n\n\nOk so when it comes to approved vendors, all Palace brides have run into the same problem you have, which is not getting the full list of approved vendors. I know that a lot has changed in the wedding department so before contacting anyone on the list I write down, confirm with your coordinator that they are still an approved vendor. If they are, save that email in case the company no longer becomes approved come your wedding date. They will honour this and not charge you fees! So the list I know of (which may be dated) is:\n\n\nAudiovisual: JSAV and PSAV\n\nDecoration: Gama, Zuniga and LatinAsia\n\nFlowers: Palace and LatinAsia\n\nLive Entertainment: a Tempo Consulting\n\nHair and Makeup: Palace salon, Styling Trio and MVP\n\nPhotographer and videographer: Dreamart\n\nPhoto booth: La Cabina\n\n\nNow this list may not be complete so any other palace bride, feel free to add or delete to this list.\n\n\nIn terms of the family photographer, I&#039;m sorry I have no idea. We hired an outside vendor.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893299,"PostDate":1429130884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282385\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282385-nelmo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nelmo<\/span><\/a>, congrats on securing your date and venue!!! Have you been appointed your offsite coordinator?<br><br>\nOk so when it comes to approved vendors, all Palace brides have run into the same problem you have, which is not getting the full list of approved vendors. I know that a lot has changed in the wedding department so before contacting anyone on the list I write down, confirm with your coordinator that they are still an approved vendor. If they are, save that email in case the company no longer becomes approved come your wedding date. They will honour this and not charge you fees! So the list I know of (which may be dated) is:<br><br>\nAudiovisual: JSAV and PSAV<br>\nDecoration: Gama, Zuniga and LatinAsia<br>\nFlowers: Palace and LatinAsia<br>\nLive Entertainment: a Tempo Consulting<br>\nHair and Makeup: Palace salon, Styling Trio and MVP<br>\nPhotographer and videographer: Dreamart<br>\nPhoto booth: La Cabina<br><br>\nNow this list may not be complete so any other palace bride, feel free to add or delete to this list.<br><br>\nIn terms of the family photographer, I'm sorry I have no idea. We hired an outside vendor.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410073385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":87,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
