ving my 2 nephews as ring bearers (or ring security agents). &amp;nbsp;One of them just turned a year old, and the other will be 10 at the time of the wedding (he&#039;s mostly there to help the little guy out!). &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m struggling with finding attire for them though - any suggestions for where I can find something? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve seen a few cute things online, but I don&#039;t want to spend too much. My partner will be wearing grey dress pants, white top, and a grey vest (with either a white or yellow tie, that part he won&#039;t tell me).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I appreciate your feedback!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888695,"PostDate":1425788012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're looking at having my 2 nephews as ring bearers (or ring security agents). \u00a0One of them just turned a year old, and the other will be 10 at the time of the wedding (he's mostly there to help the little guy out!). \u00a0I'm struggling with finding attire for them though - any suggestions for where I can find something? \u00a0I've seen a few cute things online, but I don't want to spend too much. My partner will be wearing grey dress pants, white top, and a grey vest (with either a white or yellow tie, that part he won't tell me).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I appreciate your feedback!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391395223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.14.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c536cbc7a13c494589b1d7d7324377d","RawContent":"My son, 8 is wearing a black Calvin Klein Tuxedo. Think it was $70. Bought it on amazon.\n\nIf your worried about the heat (we are not) you could look into Macy&#039;s they have separates. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1888717,"PostDate":1425829914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My son, 8 is wearing a black Calvin Klein Tuxedo. Think it was $70. Bought it on amazon.<br>\nIf your worried about the heat (we are not) you could look into Macy's they have separates. Good luck! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401136433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eccd6af3be7e9b3fde7aef7eca6af84f","RawContent":"My son wore a white button up dress shirt and black dress shorts that had some pin striping in them. They were similar to what the men wore. Both purchased from Old Navy. Pictures in my signature below. \n\n\nMen were originally going to wear white tops but then last minute switched to turquoise.  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1888720,"PostDate":1425831824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My son wore a white button up dress shirt and black dress shorts that had some pin striping in them. They were similar to what the men wore. Both purchased from Old Navy. Pictures in my signature below. <br><br>\nMen were originally going to wear white tops but then last minute switched to turquoise.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.85.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by nadiakat17, 08 March 2015 - 09:48 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1425836885,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74f9db6d90d4d0629411e1d6a8a9d74e","RawContent":"I wanted my nephew to match the guys in tan linen suits... I searched on Amazon and found a cute option for like 80$\n\n\nWe gave it to him as part of his Xmas present. He&#039;s six and notorious for being ungrateful for presents he doesn&#039;t like so we were like well if he&#039;s going to hate it anyways better give him something practical. Of course he pouted and said \" are you serious!?\" Lolol","Attachments":[],"Id":1888729,"PostDate":1425836794,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wanted my nephew to match the guys in tan linen suits... I searched on Amazon and found a cute option for like 80$<br><br>\nWe gave it to him as part of his Xmas present. He's six and notorious for being ungrateful for presents he doesn't like so we were like well if he's going to hate it anyways better give him something practical. Of course he pouted and said \" are you serious!?\" Lolol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff00cf6b4e67d8016f533df1d0ab0840","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1888729\" timestamp=\"1425836794\"]\nI wanted my nephew to match the guys in tan linen suits... I searched on Amazon and found a cute option for like 80$\n\nWe gave it to him as part of his Xmas present. He&#039;s six and notorious for being ungrateful for presents he doesn&#039;t like so we were like well if he&#039;s going to hate it anyways better give him something practical. Of course he pouted and said \" are you serious!?\" Lolol[\/quote]He&#039;s lucky I&#039;m not his mom. I would have taken all gifts away!! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1888731,"PostDate":1425838266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 08 March 2015 - 09:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I wanted my nephew to match the guys in tan linen suits... I searched on Amazon and found a cute option for like 80$<br><br>\nWe gave it to him as part of his Xmas present. He's six and notorious for being ungrateful for presents he doesn't like so we were like well if he's going to hate it anyways better give him something practical. Of course he pouted and said \" are you serious!?\" Lolol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHe's lucky I'm not his mom. I would have taken all gifts away!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.85.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c768191d418f8ceb422c8c63cfabd7b6","RawContent":"Haha @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] I know! My kids would have been in so much trouble ( my parents would never have let that fly w us) his mom chides him but that&#039;s about it. He&#039;s so spoiled since he has so many sets of families buying for him. i love him but he&#039;s getting to old to act like that. We&#039;re going to start donating to a college fund instead of presents","Attachments":[],"Id":1888733,"PostDate":1425839302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Haha @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> I know! My kids would have been in so much trouble ( my parents would never have let that fly w us) his mom chides him but that's about it. He's so spoiled since he has so many sets of families buying for him. i love him but he's getting to old to act like that. We're going to start donating to a college fund instead of presents \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.122.64.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c7a52e94e68eb080029ba8792a387ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Little update, here is what we found for my little nephew at the Bay and Children&#039;s Place. &amp;nbsp;My sister ordered a different tie and suspenders for him from etsy as well. The older one will just wear beige shorts and a white top with rolled sleeves.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":31589,"Name":"11145954_698407140708_1008353738_n.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-276456-0-30241300-1429034272.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-276456-0-30241300-1429034272_thumb.jpg","Width":720,"Height":960},{"Id":31590,"Name":"11121121_10153242615399715_1823910551_n.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-276456-0-43505000-1429034274.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-276456-0-43505000-1429034274_thumb.jpg","Width":720,"Height":960}],"Id":1893093,"PostDate":1429034291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Little update, here is what we found for my little nephew at the Bay and Children's Place. \u00a0My sister ordered a different tie and suspenders for him from etsy as well. The older one will just wear beige shorts and a white top with rolled sleeves.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391395223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.109.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78884,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73c21a6baba9bcc8309c597e5426d7b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kerrierf\"] I ordered from the same etsy shop. &amp;nbsp;The bow tie and suspenders are super cute. &amp;nbsp;Our little ring bearer will be 3 and a half. &amp;nbsp;He will be in khaki pants and white button down shirt.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893124,"PostDate":1429046352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a> I ordered from the same etsy shop. \u00a0The bow tie and suspenders are super cute. \u00a0Our little ring bearer will be 3 and a half. \u00a0He will be in khaki pants and white button down shirt.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1893124]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-279720-0-57699100-1429046260.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0053.JPG - Size: 148.71KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-279720-0-57699100-1429046260.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0053.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78884","Title":"Ring Bearer","LastPostDate":1429046352},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
