&gt;I&#039;ve decided to add a meet the guests cheat sheet to put in the welcome bags. I am having each person&#039;s name, relation to bride\/groom, and city.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right now, I have made the sheet in Word but I think there may be something better. Does anyone have a template?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve searched the forums and see really old posts but wondering if anyone had anything more up to date.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891962,"PostDate":1428325742,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've decided to add a meet the guests cheat sheet to put in the welcome bags. I am having each person's name, relation to bride\/groom, and city.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Right now, I have made the sheet in Word but I think there may be something better. Does anyone have a template?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've searched the forums and see really old posts but wondering if anyone had anything more up to date.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>58 guests plus bride and groom<br>\nCeremony: Gazebo<br>\nReception: Pool Deck","Email":"smileitseb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.90.104.129","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394223869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"smileitseb","Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79024,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0caa477bf716759260d16242acb5d3e","RawContent":"I borrowed one from a past bride but didn&#039;t end up using it - ran out of time. After the fact I wish I had so they could have used them to record room numbers (it was needed lol). I don&#039;t have it anymore though, sorry. It was @[member=\"tygrrlily\"] who shared it.  My recommendation though will all those pics is to use publisher. I found word harder to manipulate even with her template already done.  Good luck. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891964,"PostDate":1428325908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I borrowed one from a past bride but didn't end up using it - ran out of time. After the fact I wish I had so they could have used them to record room numbers (it was needed lol). I don't have it anymore though, sorry. It was @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> who shared it.  My recommendation though will all those pics is to use publisher. I found word harder to manipulate even with her template already done.  Good luck. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk