Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":135,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1893419,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282266,"Name":"OL88","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1429227702,"LastPoster":{"Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1893419,"PostDate":1429227702,"PostContent":"Hi All, \u00a0 I was wondering which resorts\/chains in Riviera Maya tend to be most affordable for a w...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olgalekakh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.255.30.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425011761,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"OL88","Id":282266,"Name":"OL88","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.36.250.56","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"256623224aa28daa06a33284b2b72b88","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was wondering which resorts\/chains in Riviera Maya tend to be most affordable for a wedding. I am looking at 50-75 guests, with private reception\/dinner in one location, so things are getting pricey. Would like a family friendly resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as ceremony, I just want some privacy so people aren&#039;t running around in their speedos right next to us, but otherwise I feel flexible on whether its on the beach\/garden, etc. Kind of picky on location of reception, I don&#039;t want it on the beach, but I&#039;m fine with a either a really pretty restaurant\/hall, or half open restaurant\/gazebo near pool\/beach type of place -- I just want it to be more on the elegant than beachy side, but an integration of both the outdoors\/destination and elegant would be most ideal.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I feel like it is very hard to compare the resorts, as certainly the base package price on websites is completely different from what it all ends up costing once you take into account the large wedding size and private reception. Also, looking for somewhere that will let us keep the party going after an 11pm cut off time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry -- I know this is a lot of requirements, but I figured I would ask because I am going crazy trying to compare everything and maybe someone has been in the same boat!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893419,"PostDate":1429227702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was wondering which resorts\/chains in Riviera Maya tend to be most affordable for a wedding. I am looking at 50-75 guests, with private reception\/dinner in one location, so things are getting pricey. Would like a family friendly resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as ceremony, I just want some privacy so people aren't running around in their speedos right next to us, but otherwise I feel flexible on whether its on the beach\/garden, etc. Kind of picky on location of reception, I don't want it on the beach, but I'm fine with a either a really pretty restaurant\/hall, or half open restaurant\/gazebo near pool\/beach type of place -- I just want it to be more on the elegant than beachy side, but an integration of both the outdoors\/destination and elegant would be most ideal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I feel like it is very hard to compare the resorts, as certainly the base package price on websites is completely different from what it all ends up costing once you take into account the large wedding size and private reception. Also, looking for somewhere that will let us keep the party going after an 11pm cut off time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry -- I know this is a lot of requirements, but I figured I would ask because I am going crazy trying to compare everything and maybe someone has been in the same boat!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olgalekakh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.255.30.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425011761,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"OL88","Id":282266,"Name":"OL88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.94.35.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2edaff0dcfbbd6d3332625c5d57735a","RawContent":"If you&#039;re set on riviera maya, I think hard rock riviera maya would be perfect for you. Hard rock and Palace Resorts seem to have the best incentives for large groups","Attachments":[],"Id":1893428,"PostDate":1429232928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you're set on riviera maya, I think hard rock riviera maya would be perfect for you. Hard rock and Palace Resorts seem to have the best incentives for large groups \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 16 guests + bride and groom + 5 kids = 52 room nights<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.36.250.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79075,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by OL88, Yesterday, 05:17 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1429233429,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8698e9862f58bc686d124c1592d0bd1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Also open to Punta Cana. Hard Rock and Palace would be awesome by me, but my other concern is guest travel expenses and I feel like while they run cheaper for the wedding couple, they are more expensive for guest travel? Am I wrong? (Looking at Now\/Riu\/Barcelo\/Iberostar price range for guest travel, perhaps I am missing some good options!.. Hard Rock and Palace seem to run 200-300$ more\/person for guest travel)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893430,"PostDate":1429233021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Also open to Punta Cana. Hard Rock and Palace would be awesome by me, but my other concern is guest travel expenses and I feel like while they run cheaper for the wedding couple, they are more expensive for guest travel? Am I wrong? (Looking at Now\/Riu\/Barcelo\/Iberostar price range for guest travel, perhaps I am missing some good options!.. Hard Rock and Palace seem to run 200-300$ more\/person for guest travel)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olgalekakh@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.255.30.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425011761,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"OL88","Id":282266,"Name":"OL88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79075,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, Yesterday, 06:26 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1429237578,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06f2ff5c8136b5b2c6b0371dd7fa5cb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I married at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya. We had the ceremony on a private beach that had a palapa for the reception right there. You can have your reception until 6am if you wanted to pay. I took the free package (free with 10 double rooms booked for 7 nights) and upgraded to this location ... then had the extra add ons that suited me. Lots of what you say I can see in this resort - worth checking out :) Not sure if all my links show up below or not (on my phone) but you can see my planning thread, wedding pics and review. If it doesn&#039;t I will make sure to post them for you. Good luck.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893440,"PostDate":1429237263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I married at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya. We had the ceremony on a private beach that had a palapa for the reception right there. You can have your reception until 6am if you wanted to pay. I took the free package (free with 10 double rooms booked for 7 nights) and upgraded to this location ... then had the extra add ons that suited me. Lots of what you say I can see in this resort - worth checking out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Not sure if all my links show up below or not (on my phone) but you can see my planning thread, wedding pics and review. If it doesn't I will make sure to post them for you. Good luck.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.74.55.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e531a2ea9f505402ae6ef1f1b6f7d52a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We just signed with the Moon Palace and what&amp;nbsp;I like about this resort is the private gazebo.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also looked at Azul &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-weddings.cfm&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-weddings.cfm&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;that has private decks or gazebo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Royalton also has a private area for wedding ceremony &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.royaltonresorts.com\/en\/riviera-cancun\/destination-weddings.aspx&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.royaltonresorts.com\/en\/riviera-cancun\/destination-weddings.aspx&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Paradisus Playa del Carmen has&amp;nbsp;the beautiful Gabi bridge that they close off for your ceremony &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-weddings.php&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-weddings.php&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have done a lot of research so feel free to reach out and I can try to help.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893461,"PostDate":1429277471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We just signed with the Moon Palace and what\u00a0I like about this resort is the private gazebo.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also looked at Azul <a href='http:\/\/www.memorablemomentsweddings.com\/Karisma-weddings.cfm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.memorable...ma-weddings.cfm<\/a>\u00a0that has private decks or gazebo<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Royalton also has a private area for wedding ceremony <a href='http:\/\/www.royaltonresorts.com\/en\/riviera-cancun\/destination-weddings.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.royaltonr...n-weddings.aspx<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Paradisus Playa del Carmen has\u00a0the beautiful Gabi bridge that they close off for your ceremony <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\/romance-weddings.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.paradisus...ce-weddings.php<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have done a lot of research so feel free to reach out and I can try to help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.craig.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.184.35.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425949901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RJE","Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79075","Title":"Affordable But Elegant Wedding Resorts?","LastPostDate":1429277471},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
