{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":231,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1893098,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282701,"Name":"kuoling","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1429034998,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1893333,"PostDate":1429196566,"PostContent":"Welcome to our forum community, kuoling and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!!\u00a0 \u00a0 Here's a link to s...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.3.133.156","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d41c6295a901363ce11b80e52d4a6cd","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi all brides to be! I am very excited that I am going to have a destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;I just love the beach at Cancun after the visit last summer. Ocean water is just unreal...it&#039;s the most beautiful beach I&#039;ve seen so far. &amp;nbsp;As you all know, planning is a long and tedious process and I am already being indecisive on the resorts. I have few resorts in mind and I would like to hear your opinions. Whether you heard, been or had a wedding at those resorts, please provide some insights!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I would like to have the ceremony on a terrace, gazebo or lawn (just not on the beach) with estimated guests 25-30. I haven&#039;t been to any of these resorts only done research. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;1. Iberostar Cancun&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I know this is a big resorts and has a lot of amenities. &amp;nbsp;The room cost is reasonable. &amp;nbsp;However, the hotel seems older? &amp;nbsp;Also, I NEED WEDDING CONTACT for this hotel. &amp;nbsp;I emailed them for the wedding detail and got no response. Brides, please provide if you have their contact!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;2. Beach Palace&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;This is the smallest and most expensive of the 4 resorts. &amp;nbsp;Looks like a lot of people had\/are going to have their weddings hold here. The sky terrace just looks amazing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;3. ME Cancun&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I actually couldn&#039;t find a lot of wedding information online for this resort. &amp;nbsp;Is there a reason why people don&#039;t have their weddings here? Hotel looks modern and nice. &amp;nbsp;I got wedding information from their sales agent and the wedding package looks reasonable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;4. Fiesta Americana Condesa&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;This looks like a big resort too, very comparable to Iberostar. &amp;nbsp;One thing concerns me is their food...they don&#039;t look like they have Asian restaurant onsite? Majority of my group, including me and my fiance are Asian, and it may be a problem if they don&#039;t serve Asian food at all :P . &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;We are planning to do a site visit in June. I would like to narrow down to 2 or 3 and really take a look. &amp;nbsp;Please help!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;If you happen to have pictures\/info please send to me at kuolingchung@yahoo.com. &amp;nbsp;Thank you all!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893098,"PostDate":1429034998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi all brides to be! I am very excited that I am going to have a destination wedding. \u00a0I just love the beach at Cancun after the visit last summer. Ocean water is just unreal...it's the most beautiful beach I've seen so far. \u00a0As you all know, planning is a long and tedious process and I am already being indecisive on the resorts. I have few resorts in mind and I would like to hear your opinions. Whether you heard, been or had a wedding at those resorts, please provide some insights!\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I would like to have the ceremony on a terrace, gazebo or lawn (just not on the beach) with estimated guests 25-30. I haven't been to any of these resorts only done research. \u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><u>1. Iberostar Cancun<\/u><\/div>\n<div>I know this is a big resorts and has a lot of amenities. \u00a0The room cost is reasonable. \u00a0However, the hotel seems older? \u00a0Also, I NEED WEDDING CONTACT for this hotel. \u00a0I emailed them for the wedding detail and got no response. Brides, please provide if you have their contact!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><u>2. Beach Palace\u00a0<\/u><\/div>\n<div>This is the smallest and most expensive of the 4 resorts. \u00a0Looks like a lot of people had\/are going to have their weddings hold here. The sky terrace just looks amazing.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><u>3. ME Cancun<\/u><\/div>\n<div>I actually couldn't find a lot of wedding information online for this resort. \u00a0Is there a reason why people don't have their weddings here? Hotel looks modern and nice. \u00a0I got wedding information from their sales agent and the wedding package looks reasonable.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><u>4. Fiesta Americana Condesa\u00a0<\/u><\/div>\n<div>This looks like a big resort too, very comparable to Iberostar. \u00a0One thing concerns me is their food...they don't look like they have Asian restaurant onsite? Majority of my group, including me and my fiance are Asian, and it may be a problem if they don't serve Asian food at all <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> . \u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>We are planning to do a site visit in June. I would like to narrow down to 2 or 3 and really take a look. \u00a0Please help!!\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>If you happen to have pictures\/info please send to me at kuolingchung@yahoo.com. \u00a0Thank you all!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuolingchung@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.3.133.156","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428739919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kuoling","Id":282701,"Name":"kuoling","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by perianjay, 14 April 2015 - 10:28 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1429036106,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"214680c12755520dd68c18259c1b5b4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are having ours at Beach Palace and extremely happy with our choice. We have been to the resort before and we love it there.. It is small, but that&#039;s sometimes a really good thing. We have stayed at the sister resort (Moon Palace) and it&#039;s MASSIVE..also a beautiful resort, but for the wedding we wanted something more intimate.. plus the beach at Beach Palace is perfect. We are getting married on the sky terrace and i&#039;m really excited about it because I was a bit worried about the privacy if we were to be married directly on the beach. We are having 30 guests :) I can also say that Beach Palace probably has the best food out of any of the resorts i&#039;ve stayed at in Mexico in the five times i&#039;ve been to Cancun.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893101,"PostDate":1429036079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are having ours at Beach Palace and extremely happy with our choice. We have been to the resort before and we love it there.. It is small, but that's sometimes a really good thing. We have stayed at the sister resort (Moon Palace) and it's MASSIVE..also a beautiful resort, but for the wedding we wanted something more intimate.. plus the beach at Beach Palace is perfect. We are getting married on the sky terrace and i'm really excited about it because I was a bit worried about the privacy if we were to be married directly on the beach. We are having 30 guests <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can also say that Beach Palace probably has the best food out of any of the resorts i've stayed at in Mexico in the five times i've been to Cancun.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4464941e586a6249bf042669b43d06c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, kuoling and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to some reviews of the resorts in our magnificent Mayan Riviera area: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/11-riviera-maya-cancun\/&#039;&gt;Mayan Riviera Resorts Reviews&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some visual reasons why it&#039;s such a popular choice for so many wedding couples......&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268284102_o.jpg\" alt=\"10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1779993_10152168341559487_765040290_o.jpg\" alt=\"1779993_10152168341559487_765040290_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....you can see more magical wedding \"moments that matter\" at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893333,"PostDate":1429196566,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, kuoling and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to some reviews of the resorts in our magnificent Mayan Riviera area: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/c\/11-riviera-maya-cancun\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Mayan Riviera Resorts Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some visual reasons why it's such a popular choice for so many wedding couples......<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268284102_o.jpg\" alt=\"10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1779993_10152168341559487_765040290_o.jpg\" alt=\"1779993_10152168341559487_765040290_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....you can see more magical wedding \"moments that matter\" at this link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79063","Title":"2016 Wedding At Cancun Mexico. Need Opinions On The Resorts!","LastPostDate":1429196566},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
