 Airplane luggage tag favors.&amp;nbsp; These were a hit at my wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Twelve airplane luggage favors leftover from my destination wedding. The airplane is a silver metal and the strap to affix it to luggage is a vinyl or plastic. Brand is Kate Aspen. They come wrapped in plastic and in a small favor box with a \"thank you\" tag attached.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Here is a listing for the luggage tags from target now &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.target.com\/p\/kate-aspen-bon-voyage-silver-finish-airplane-luggage-tag\/-\/A-14519164?ref=tgt_adv_XSG10001&amp;amp;AFID=google_pla_df&amp;amp;LNM=14519164&amp;amp;CPNG=Seasonal&amp;amp;kpid=14519164&amp;amp;LID=20pgs&amp;amp;ci_src=17588969&amp;amp;ci_sku=14519164&amp;amp;kpid=14519164&amp;amp;gclid=CMj4sv-mlMICFQET7AodTCsAWg&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.target.com\/p\/kate-aspen-bon-voyage-silver-finish-airplane-luggage-tag\/-\/A-14519164?ref=tgt_adv_XSG10001&amp;amp;AFID=google_pla_df&amp;amp;LNM=14519164&amp;amp;CPNG=Seasonal&amp;amp;kpid=14519164&amp;amp;LID=20pgs&amp;amp;ci_src=17588969&amp;amp;ci_sku=14519164&amp;amp;kpid=14519164&amp;amp;gclid=CMj4sv-mlMICFQET7AodTCsAWg&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;$30 for 6!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879074,"PostDate":1416868600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 10