{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":24,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1891,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1883373,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1421706681,"LastPoster":{"Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":98,"Preview":{"Id":1883373,"PostDate":1421706681,"PostContent":"Hello ladies I'm finally unpacking some of our wedding things.\u00a0 I don't have a lot to sell - we l...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.113.233.65","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by tygrrlily, 19 January 2015 - 02:51 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1421707908,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ea87231484f99caaa2e60cc29de316a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies\n\n\nI&#039;m finally unpacking some of our wedding things.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t have a lot to sell - we left a lot at our hotel instead of lugging things back.&amp;nbsp; But in case anybody wants them, here is what I have.&amp;nbsp; I prefer to sell the cups, candles and frames to local GTA ladies as I&#039;m not sure how to ship these and don&#039;t want them to break.&amp;nbsp; The other things I will let you know the actual shipping costs and that is what you will pay.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Payment will be cash in person or paypal&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I might be adding more as I continue to unpack :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Items for Sale&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Anthropologie LOVE mugs - Selling as a set for $15&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used these on our cake table, filled w\/ flowers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s4.postimg.org\/ejguj0hcd\/IMG_7382.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7382.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&amp;amp;oe=5561CDD7&amp;amp;__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10402056_10152584544512510_1074734558886987238_n.jpg?oh=9f45ee81e4ab92df72872940790df2c8&amp;amp;oe=552EF1BD&amp;amp;__gda__=1433238955_fddee7d3b2e8e87a82094ea8e0d9de97\" alt=\"10402056_10152584544512510_1074734558886\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. 17 gold mercury votives w\/ led tealights - selling as a lot for $25 &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Votives bought from Michaels and led tealights from Costco.&amp;nbsp; We used these for all 3 of our events (welcome party, rehearsal dinner, wedding) and I&#039;d actually keep them for future parties if we had the space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s10.postimg.org\/e5snntpx5\/IMG_7385.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7385.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10407181_10152961373802510_4445903120812443199_n.jpg?oh=0b7aeabad82056249a8db82b26671184&amp;amp;oe=555CB25A&amp;amp;__gda__=1428504357_d54efae8fb422238e9fba1e9cca8d1e0\" alt=\"10407181_10152961373802510_4445903120812\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3.&amp;nbsp; 2 bridesmaid real touch bouquets from Bloom Bridal.&amp;nbsp; Selling both for $50 or $30 each.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 or 2 of the flowers are a bit squished (I think you can just fluff them out) and it looks like each is missing 1 pearl pick. I&#039;d say they&#039;re at about an 8\/10 condition.&amp;nbsp; Paid quite a bit for them.&amp;nbsp; Has peonies, plumeria, orchids, calla lillies and roses, ivory satin ribbon and pearl picks.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/lwbzmmwuz\/IMG_7389.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7389.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/8tgd3d6mz\/IMG_7390.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7390.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10923220_10152961368817510_3883073100954730019_n.jpg?oh=316a15656341c3a4a199b9aee66ea17d&amp;amp;oe=55336801&amp;amp;__gda__=1432572516_770f28aecda392bbadeeb47e8ec3c564\" alt=\"10923220_10152961368817510_3883073100954\"&gt;\n\n&amp;gt;&amp;gt; bouquet on the right&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. 3 real touch boutonnieres - Selling all three for $20&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also from Bloom Bridal. 2 pink calla lily with ivory ribbon and 2 pearl accents. 1 white calla lily with black and white striped ribbon and 2 pearl accents.&amp;nbsp; Never used and in 10\/10 condition - groom and groomsmen decided not to wear them the day of the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s24.postimg.org\/kt5d6u2b9\/IMG_7391.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7391.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Lot of 4 picture frames in gold and white.&amp;nbsp; Selling the lot for $15&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 is baroque white style, 1 is white w\/ a subtle print.&amp;nbsp; 1 is gold rimmed and mirrored chrome and 1 is plain gold. We used these to decorate our guestbook\/welcome table.&amp;nbsp; Bought from Homesense.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s11.postimg.org\/953vx0kmr\/IMG_7388.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7388.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/ubhkdipul\/welcome_table.png\" alt=\"welcome_table.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. 8 self-inking stamps from Michaels.&amp;nbsp; WIll sell the lot for $7 and throw in an acid free scrapbook pen (not the pen shown)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Used once to decorate our guestbook.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s12.postimg.org\/eiym3qj59\/IMG_7394.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7394.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. 2 ring bearer suspender and bowtie sets worn once - $10 each or both sets for $15&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are SO cute.&amp;nbsp; They fit size: 9 MONTHS - 4 YEARS and are adjustable. They are navy suspenders, grey and white gingham check bowtie&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s11.postimg.org\/kuhivu7ar\/Screen_Shot_2015_01_19_at_5_06_08_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2015_01_19_at_5_06_08_PM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1908058_10152961356837510_7286512777879349818_n.jpg?oh=e0c17a5ce48a8add5aa5f91c5a1a87e0&amp;amp;oe=555FB40B&amp;amp;__gda__=1428657460_69be96da07868d0f8d3e14ecd541d9e8\" alt=\"1908058_10152961356837510_72865127778793\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8. 4 132\" round blush pink crinkle taffeta tablecloths.&amp;nbsp; Prefer to sell as a group for $60 total&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These fit tables up to 72\" but would look best on standard 66\" or 72\" round tables.&amp;nbsp; Pictured here with 72\" round tables.&amp;nbsp; Used once and have been washed.&amp;nbsp; Great because the crinkle look means they don&#039;t have to be ironed or steamed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10940591_10152961374772510_6267457744828141319_n.jpg?oh=6476b2be0d59b4620c246cf098cd57cc&amp;amp;oe=5521B673&amp;amp;__gda__=1428732261_a2d11bdf9ebcb727185677d93b6282c8\" alt=\"10940591_10152961374772510_6267457744828\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s10.postimg.org\/arp6fw9gp\/decor.png\" alt=\"decor.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9. 2 90\"x156\" matching blush pink crinkle taffeta table drapes. $20 each or both for $30&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used 1 for our head table and 1 for our welcome\/guestbook table.&amp;nbsp; They will fit standard 8&#039; rectangular tables&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10492159_10152961377057510_24223994546031638_n.jpg?oh=75a41fec34e3247ef2fc2de7a84827b9&amp;amp;oe=5520E7B3&amp;amp;__gda__=1428567001_c1aa2d994f2b4f36b80a825ec4e9aef3\" alt=\"10492159_10152961377057510_2422399454603\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10933830_10152961371737510_5068111883325408724_n.jpg?oh=400a1744cfaf1f630f0d2e999ddcc7c2&amp;amp;oe=552CCF1D&amp;amp;__gda__=1428558832_ea5cdeaed15f3545f566145017e02e76\" alt=\"10933830_10152961371737510_5068111883325\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10. Black and white striped runner - Selling for $15&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This will fit an 8 foot table perfectly.&amp;nbsp; Dimensions are 16\" wide and 156\" long (will hit the floor).&amp;nbsp; Had this custom made to use at our head table.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10498308_10152961373652510_7072509454761324867_o.jpg\" alt=\"10498308_10152961373652510_7072509454761\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11.&amp;nbsp; Gold sequin 120\" round table cloth.&amp;nbsp; Selling for $55&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I LOVE this tablecloth and I want to keep it but my husband said we have no use for it haha.&amp;nbsp; We used this on our cake table (square table) and it was great. Sequins are square shaped and gold&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&amp;amp;oe=5561CDD7&amp;amp;__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10899972_10152961378597510_706156497058081055_o.jpg\" alt=\"10899972_10152961378597510_7061564970580\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12. 5 plastic table number frames from Michaels. All for $5&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I spray painted them gold and tore out the plastic sheet so it looked less cheap.&amp;nbsp; They measure about 3-4 inches long each.&amp;nbsp; I can leave in my table number cards - printed on a gold shimmer cardstock.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/687zk5bc1\/IMG_7386.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7386.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/zbw7gdzfl\/IMG_7387.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7387.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I suck at spray painting :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10931185_10152961374012510_4823865361100914270_n.jpg?oh=01b82d827202b249e9dbabb2530ce75e&amp;amp;oe=5532128C\" alt=\"10931185_10152961374012510_4823865361100\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;13. Black Wally 60\" garment bag.&amp;nbsp; Selling for $30&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Used this to transport my wedding dress, TTD and veils. Has a mechanism at the top that secures the hangers and can hang up to 6 garments.&amp;nbsp; Not this is NOT the 66\" DW bag that retails for $150&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/ecx.images-amazon.com\/images\/I\/91ez3YMaMCL._SL1500_.jpg\" alt=\"91ez3YMaMCL._SL1500_.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s it for now - I&#039;ll probably add more as I continue to unpack.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also going to post my dress on preownedweddingdresses if anyone is interested.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know if you have any questions or want more pics!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883373,"PostDate":1421706681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies<br><br>\nI'm finally unpacking some of our wedding things.\u00a0 I don't have a lot to sell - we left a lot at our hotel instead of lugging things back.\u00a0 But in case anybody wants them, here is what I have.\u00a0 I prefer to sell the cups, candles and frames to local GTA ladies as I'm not sure how to ship these and don't want them to break.\u00a0 The other things I will let you know the actual shipping costs and that is what you will pay.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Payment will be cash in person or paypal<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I might be adding more as I continue to unpack <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Items for Sale<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>1. Anthropologie LOVE mugs - Selling as a set for $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We used these on our cake table, filled w\/ flowers.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s4.postimg.org\/ejguj0hcd\/IMG_7382.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7382.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&oe=5561CDD7&__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10402056_10152584544512510_1074734558886987238_n.jpg?oh=9f45ee81e4ab92df72872940790df2c8&oe=552EF1BD&__gda__=1433238955_fddee7d3b2e8e87a82094ea8e0d9de97\" alt=\"10402056_10152584544512510_1074734558886\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2. 17 gold mercury votives w\/ led tealights - selling as a lot for $25 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Votives bought from Michaels and led tealights from Costco.\u00a0 We used these for all 3 of our events (welcome party, rehearsal dinner, wedding) and I'd actually keep them for future parties if we had the space.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s10.postimg.org\/e5snntpx5\/IMG_7385.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7385.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10407181_10152961373802510_4445903120812443199_n.jpg?oh=0b7aeabad82056249a8db82b26671184&oe=555CB25A&__gda__=1428504357_d54efae8fb422238e9fba1e9cca8d1e0\" alt=\"10407181_10152961373802510_4445903120812\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>3.\u00a0 2 bridesmaid real touch bouquets from Bloom Bridal.\u00a0 Selling both for $50 or $30 each.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1 or 2 of the flowers are a bit squished (I think you can just fluff them out) and it looks like each is missing 1 pearl pick. I'd say they're at about an 8\/10 condition.\u00a0 Paid quite a bit for them.\u00a0 Has peonies, plumeria, orchids, calla lillies and roses, ivory satin ribbon and pearl picks.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/lwbzmmwuz\/IMG_7389.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7389.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7.postimg.org\/8tgd3d6mz\/IMG_7390.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7390.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10923220_10152961368817510_3883073100954730019_n.jpg?oh=316a15656341c3a4a199b9aee66ea17d&oe=55336801&__gda__=1432572516_770f28aecda392bbadeeb47e8ec3c564\" alt=\"10923220_10152961368817510_3883073100954\"><\/span><br>\n>> bouquet on the right<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>4. 3 real touch boutonnieres - Selling all three for $20<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Also from Bloom Bridal. 2 pink calla lily with ivory ribbon and 2 pearl accents. 1 white calla lily with black and white striped ribbon and 2 pearl accents.\u00a0 Never used and in 10\/10 condition - groom and groomsmen decided not to wear them the day of the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s24.postimg.org\/kt5d6u2b9\/IMG_7391.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7391.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>5. Lot of 4 picture frames in gold and white.\u00a0 Selling the lot for $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1 is baroque white style, 1 is white w\/ a subtle print.\u00a0 1 is gold rimmed and mirrored chrome and 1 is plain gold. We used these to decorate our guestbook\/welcome table.\u00a0 Bought from Homesense.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s11.postimg.org\/953vx0kmr\/IMG_7388.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7388.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s28.postimg.org\/ubhkdipul\/welcome_table.png\" alt=\"welcome_table.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>6. 8 self-inking stamps from Michaels.\u00a0 WIll sell the lot for $7 and throw in an acid free scrapbook pen (not the pen shown)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Used once to decorate our guestbook.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s12.postimg.org\/eiym3qj59\/IMG_7394.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7394.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>7. 2 ring bearer suspender and bowtie sets worn once - $10 each or both sets for $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These are SO cute.\u00a0 They fit size: 9 MONTHS - 4 YEARS and are adjustable. They are navy suspenders, grey and white gingham check bowtie<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s11.postimg.org\/kuhivu7ar\/Screen_Shot_2015_01_19_at_5_06_08_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2015_01_19_at_5_06_08_PM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1908058_10152961356837510_7286512777879349818_n.jpg?oh=e0c17a5ce48a8add5aa5f91c5a1a87e0&oe=555FB40B&__gda__=1428657460_69be96da07868d0f8d3e14ecd541d9e8\" alt=\"1908058_10152961356837510_72865127778793\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>8. 4 132\" round blush pink crinkle taffeta tablecloths.\u00a0 Prefer to sell as a group for $60 total<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These fit tables up to 72\" but would look best on standard 66\" or 72\" round tables.\u00a0 Pictured here with 72\" round tables.\u00a0 Used once and have been washed.\u00a0 Great because the crinkle look means they don't have to be ironed or steamed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10940591_10152961374772510_6267457744828141319_n.jpg?oh=6476b2be0d59b4620c246cf098cd57cc&oe=5521B673&__gda__=1428732261_a2d11bdf9ebcb727185677d93b6282c8\" alt=\"10940591_10152961374772510_6267457744828\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s10.postimg.org\/arp6fw9gp\/decor.png\" alt=\"decor.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>9. 2 90\"x156\" matching blush pink crinkle taffeta table drapes. $20 each or both for $30<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We used 1 for our head table and 1 for our welcome\/guestbook table.\u00a0 They will fit standard 8' rectangular tables<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10492159_10152961377057510_24223994546031638_n.jpg?oh=75a41fec34e3247ef2fc2de7a84827b9&oe=5520E7B3&__gda__=1428567001_c1aa2d994f2b4f36b80a825ec4e9aef3\" alt=\"10492159_10152961377057510_2422399454603\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10933830_10152961371737510_5068111883325408724_n.jpg?oh=400a1744cfaf1f630f0d2e999ddcc7c2&oe=552CCF1D&__gda__=1428558832_ea5cdeaed15f3545f566145017e02e76\" alt=\"10933830_10152961371737510_5068111883325\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>10. Black and white striped runner - Selling for $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>This will fit an 8 foot table perfectly.\u00a0 Dimensions are 16\" wide and 156\" long (will hit the floor).\u00a0 Had this custom made to use at our head table.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10498308_10152961373652510_7072509454761324867_o.jpg\" alt=\"10498308_10152961373652510_7072509454761\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>11.\u00a0 Gold sequin 120\" round table cloth.\u00a0 Selling for $55<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I LOVE this tablecloth and I want to keep it but my husband said we have no use for it haha.\u00a0 We used this on our cake table (square table) and it was great. Sequins are square shaped and gold<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&oe=5561CDD7&__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10899972_10152961378597510_706156497058081055_o.jpg\" alt=\"10899972_10152961378597510_7061564970580\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>12. 5 plastic table number frames from Michaels. All for $5<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I spray painted them gold and tore out the plastic sheet so it looked less cheap.\u00a0 They measure about 3-4 inches long each.\u00a0 I can leave in my table number cards - printed on a gold shimmer cardstock.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/687zk5bc1\/IMG_7386.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7386.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s30.postimg.org\/zbw7gdzfl\/IMG_7387.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7387.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>>> I suck at spray painting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10931185_10152961374012510_4823865361100914270_n.jpg?oh=01b82d827202b249e9dbabb2530ce75e&oe=5532128C\" alt=\"10931185_10152961374012510_4823865361100\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>13. Black Wally 60\" garment bag.\u00a0 Selling for $30<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Used this to transport my wedding dress, TTD and veils. Has a mechanism at the top that secures the hangers and can hang up to 6 garments.\u00a0 Not this is NOT the 66\" DW bag that retails for $150<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/ecx.images-amazon.com\/images\/I\/91ez3YMaMCL._SL1500_.jpg\" alt=\"91ez3YMaMCL._SL1500_.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's it for now - I'll probably add more as I continue to unpack.\u00a0 I'm also going to post my dress on preownedweddingdresses if anyone is interested.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any questions or want more pics!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"561fd0e55b9d793fdcc723c17fd8ec08","RawContent":"@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] I&#039;m very interested in the votives and led team\n\nItchy set, as well as the Wally bag. Can you pm me on details re shipping? Thanks!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1883380,"PostDate":1421714090,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> I'm very interested in the votives and led team<br>\nItchy set, as well as the Wally bag. Can you pm me on details re shipping? Thanks!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee810ae2abdda2d28536ea9f3fb41a89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Do you still have the love mugs?!! :) How much would shipping be to T3K 4V8?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883384,"PostDate":1421718476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Do you still have the love mugs?!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> How much would shipping be to T3K 4V8?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7068fb78a64f82ee8c1b513d6601eade","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Depending on what happens, I would take the Wally bag and the bouts and I&#039;m at University and Richmond. I go back and forth between Union Station too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883393,"PostDate":1421722078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Depending on what happens, I would take the Wally bag and the bouts and I'm at University and Richmond. I go back and forth between Union Station too.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.113.233.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by tygrrlily, 19 January 2015 - 07:31 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1421724714,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acbc722686d4b589ff60abc45f72e4f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve had a couple of inquiries about the Wally bag.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m going to just go in order of contact.&amp;nbsp; I do have someone that messaged me first.   I&#039;m going to find shipping costs first then just work my way down the list&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will PM everyone separately for the other things&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;and just a note - as I mentioned above, I DO prefer to sell to local ladies as it&#039;s a bit easier than shipping. So if I get multiple offers on an item and somebody is local, I will likely go the local route to make it easier.&amp;nbsp; But otherwise I am happy to ship items if people are willing to pay shipping costs&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883399,"PostDate":1421724205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've had a couple of inquiries about the Wally bag.\u00a0 I'm going to just go in order of contact.\u00a0 I do have someone that messaged me first.\u00a0\u00a0 I'm going to find shipping costs first then just work my way down the list<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will PM everyone separately for the other things<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and just a note - as I mentioned above, I DO prefer to sell to local ladies as it's a bit easier than shipping. So if I get multiple offers on an item and somebody is local, I will likely go the local route to make it easier.\u00a0 But otherwise I am happy to ship items if people are willing to pay shipping costs\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrli