                 body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Do you still have the love mugs, votives, and table number frames?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 16 guests + bride and groom + 5 kids = 52 room nights<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401302870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"260ecb607f2e9d163e88623ff8b2007c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TheBHolders\"] - Just an FYI for you and the other lovely ladies from the US. The shipping costs can be horrendous from Canada, which is where we are and where @[member=\"tygrrlily\"] is. Also for some items there will be a customs fee so it will add up quite quickly.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883577,"PostDate":1421810359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n        