ot including alterations)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><strong>Asking Price With Shipping:<\/strong> $625.00 shipping inc (in Canada) <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><strong>Asking Price Without Shipping:<\/strong> $550.00 (GTA area pick up)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.essensedesigns.com\/stella-york\/dresses\/detail\/5504' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.essensede...ses\/detail\/5504<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/cdn.essensedesigns.com\/assets\/img\/dresses\/stella-york\/5504\/5504_main_detail.jpg\" alt=\"5504_main_detail.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"teals12@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.150.81.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304648196,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239693.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"teals","Id":239693,"Name":"teals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78636,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a15065e733c726a4f54bdcecae0f6730","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a gorgeous dress! Sadly I haven&#039;t been a size 6 for quite a few years!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll find someone to buy such a beautiful dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883394,"PostDate":1421722553,"P